// Callas decision flow (Eraser flowchart)
// The LLM never decides between warning and replying. Fixed rules do.
title Callas decision flow
direction down
colorMode bold
styleMode plain
typeface clean

Start [shape: oval, icon: play, label: "Input arrives"]
Input type [shape: diamond, icon: help-circle, label: "Message or call?"]

Message [color: gray] {
  Analyze message [icon: file-text, label: "NER, summary, scam check"]
  Show message verdict [shape: oval, icon: flag, label: "Show verdict: safe, suspicious, or scam"]
}

Audio in [color: teal] {
  Audio source [shape: diamond, icon: mic, label: "Recording or live mic?"]
  Transcribe file [icon: file-audio, label: "Transcribe and split speakers"]
  Stream mic [icon: radio, label: "Stream text while caller speaks"]
  Silence [shape: diamond, icon: pause, label: "0.8 s of silence or 15 s turn?"]
  Next turn [icon: corner-down-right, label: "Next turn"]
}

Turn [color: purple] {
  Remember [icon: layers, label: "Add turn to call memory"]
  Analyze turn [icon: cpu, label: "NER, summary, scam check on whole call so far"]
  Already escalated [shape: diamond, icon: alert-triangle, label: "Call already escalated?"]
  Scam found [shape: diamond, icon: shield, label: "Scam, or answer unknown?"]
}

Warn [color: red] {
  Escalate [icon: alert-octagon, label: "Mark call escalated (stays until call ends)"]
  Warn user [shape: oval, icon: bell, label: "Warn user, no reply"]
}

Reply [color: green] {
  Mask [icon: eye-off, label: "Mask numbers, names, links from the call"]
  Ask LLM [icon: message-circle, label: "LLM writes short reply (prompt or DSPy)"]
  Reply usable [shape: diamond, icon: check-circle, label: "Reply returned, under 200 chars?"]
  Leak check [shape: diamond, icon: lock, label: "Leak rules pass?"]
  Judge [shape: diamond, icon: shield, label: "DSPy judge on: says no leak?"]
  Use template [icon: file, label: "Use fixed template"]
  Speak [icon: volume-2, label: "Speak reply (mic paused while it plays)"]
}

Call over [shape: diamond, icon: phone-off, label: "Call ended?"]
Delete memory [shape: oval, icon: trash-2, label: "Delete call memory"]

Start > Input type
Input type > Analyze message: message
Analyze message > Show message verdict
Input type > Audio source: call
Audio source > Transcribe file: recording
Audio source > Stream mic: live
Stream mic > Silence
Silence > Stream mic: no
Silence > Remember: yes
Transcribe file > Remember: each turn in order
Remember > Analyze turn
Analyze turn > Already escalated
Already escalated > Warn user: yes
Already escalated > Scam found: no
Scam found > Escalate: yes
Escalate > Warn user
Scam found > Mask: no
Mask > Ask LLM
Ask LLM > Reply usable
Reply usable > Use template: no
Reply usable > Leak check: yes
Leak check > Use template: no
Leak check > Judge: yes
Judge > Use template: no or error
Judge > Speak: yes, or judge off
Use template > Speak
Warn user > Call over
Speak > Call over
Call over > Next turn: no
Next turn > Stream mic: live
Next turn > Remember: recording, next turn
Call over > Delete memory: yes
